{"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.072839775085449254,"h":0.014991417650058736,"t":"Reading","x":0.83500606780034636,"y":0.11263311507401697},{"y":0.15400471133163163,"w":0.7016460673014322,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"D In addition to this, there is also the education that can take place in zoos through","x":0.17901235719290526},{"x":0.2159657296229659,"c":1,"w":0.66273101806640622,"t":"signs, talks and presentations which directly communicate information to visitors","h":0.018086313218475092,"y":0.1682102028629523},{"x":0.21805495514643194,"w":0.66061040242513025,"c":1,"y":0.18411269332956115,"t":"about the animals they are seeing and their place in the world. This was an area","h":0.016123708763167488},{"t":"where zoos used to be lacking, but they are now increasingly sophisticated in","x":0.21805938159404756,"c":1,"w":0.63796569824218752,"y":0.20032792753644879,"h":0.015492483078380359},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"their communication and outreach work. Many zoos also work directly to educate","y":0.21643109531114457,"w":0.66872426350911462,"x":0.2160493908465016,"c":1},{"x":0.22009707594798139,"y":0.23066445560894011,"h":0.01753952084778343,"c":1,"w":0.63184661865234371,"t":"conservation workers in other countries, or send their animal keepers abroad"},{"h":0.016525258445065805,"t":"to contribute their knowledge and skills to those working in zoos and reserves,","y":0.24513841315330942,"c":1,"w":0.64625554402669272,"x":0.21803116911689832},{"c":1,"y":0.26154992614730599,"h":0.014985165410665302,"t":"thereby helping to improve conditions and reintroductions all over the world.","x":0.21805771343121269,"w":0.62560618082682284},{"y":0.28321495752452874,"x":0.19948865098885715,"t":"Zoos also play a key role in research. If we are to save wild species and restore","w":0.67511210123697918,"h":0.018966016555983845,"c":1},{"w":0.681243896484375,"h":0.017758114458674923,"c":1,"x":0.22007072506178096,"y":0.30006375855834377,"t":"and repair ecosystems we need to know about how key species live, act and react."},{"w":0.66471023559570308,"h":0.014996990298213886,"c":1,"x":0.22012522795812628,"t":"Being able to undertake research on animals in zoos where there is less risk and","y":0.31652078714570575},{"y":0.33124708586050766,"h":0.018262426198862869,"c":1,"x":0.21599342685233117,"t":"fewer variables means real changes can be effected on wild populations. Finding","w":0.66883865356445305},{"h":0.016987874735370445,"t":"out about, for example, the oestrus cycle of an animal or its breeding rate helps","y":0.34725165547704551,"w":0.65444437662760424,"c":1,"x":0.21804327541051408},{"h":0.013084819375836831,"x":0.22016460919067204,"c":1,"t":"us manage wild populations. Procedures such as capturing and moving at-risk or","w":0.66666666666666663,"y":0.36336866910654253},{"x":0.21802051816344981,"h":0.017877640516373194,"y":0.37779593195384886,"c":1,"w":0.6750839742024739,"t":"dangerous individuals are bolstered by knowledge gained in zoos about doses for"},{"x":0.21804064500730647,"y":0.39361061232510175,"w":0.65240885416666672,"h":0.017317181060395592,"c":1,"t":"anaesthetics, and by experience in handling and transporting animals. This can"},{"h":0.014489904028507361,"y":0.40832365056438191,"c":1,"x":0.22011073285008004,"t":"make a real difference to conservation efforts and to the reduction of human-animal","w":0.68940678914388021},{"y":0.42397420622563919,"t":"conflicts, and can provide a knowledge base for helping with the increasing threats","x":0.21803950710381342,"h":0.018102402681456353,"w":0.68121210734049487,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"of habitat destruction and other problems.","x":0.2201646070545856,"w":0.34567901611328122,"y":0.44186046499415144,"h":0.013086531271782831},{"y":0.46355463334399993,"c":1,"x":0.21600945788739959,"h":0.017818058899069622,"w":0.6852857462565104,"t":"In conclusion, considering the many ongoing global threats to the environment, it is"},{"c":1,"x":0.22012604590022458,"y":0.47963299437778451,"h":0.014321362031503027,"t":"hard for me to see zoos as anything other than essential to the long-term survival","w":0.66881963094075525},{"w":0.67092763264973954,"t":"of numerous species. They are vital not just in terms of protecting animals, but as","h":0.017489885974969366,"c":1,"y":0.49488187356983404,"x":0.2180389758904287},{"c":1,"y":0.50982467180048985,"t":"a means of learning about them to aid those still in the wild, as well as educating","x":0.21803953451515043,"h":0.0168205464546195,"w":0.66268717447916659},{"c":1,"h":0.016467540368033995,"x":0.2180551011431415,"w":0.66473576863606765,"y":0.52597320744460485,"t":"and informing the general population about these animals and their world so that"},{"x":0.21802943176123668,"y":0.54052902297158634,"w":0.67502660115559909,"h":0.017103895000911584,"c":1,"t":"they can assist or at least accept the need to be more environmentally conscious."},{"y":0.55665629947716089,"x":0.22010845189370531,"c":1,"w":0.61535583496093749,"h":0.018151166441864541,"t":"Without them, the world would be, and would increasingly become, a much"},{"y":0.57412790672690317,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"poorer place.","w":0.11111110687255857,"c":1,"x":0.22016461142997582},{"t":"87","w":0.022633744875590001,"x":0.88271604939348058,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.8677325578911671}],"w":2400,"h":3395}